message: >
  If you use Watermarked Signatures in a project that generates a research output, please cite this software in addition to citing REDCap.

type: software

title: "Watermarked Signatures (REDCap External Module)"

abstract: >
  Watermarked Signatures is a REDCap External Module that adds a visible, context-bound watermark to newly captured REDCap signatures.

